  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone, ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "I am looking for a fedora-commons forum or something like this for dummies-users like me. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's the first time I try this software and I have done all procedures for quick and custom installation.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "First I have done all operations listed here for quick installation (see ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Utoymym_yaI)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Utoymym_yaI)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " but when i go to the page \"localhost:8080/fedora/describe\" I always get this message: \" javax.servlet.ServletException: Unable to get Fedora Server instance.The Fedora server is not yet running\"- but \"Startup.bat\", the tomcat server, works fine. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "What is my problem? There are problems with java 1.6? When i try custom installation for using postgresql i get the same error. I am pretty sure that the error is in the installation procedure...but where??",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The guide online is too poor for users that have no experience with this environment...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you very much and sorry for my bad english.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "windows xp SP3, tomcat 6.0, java 1.6 , postgreSQL 8.2,  amd64 3000+ , 1.2 Gb ram",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
