      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I believe the reason this error occurred was due to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-396\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-396\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Tomcat 6 and Jetty Installation Problems\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-396\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (tomcat 6 installation issues), which was fixed in Fedora 3.3.  Closed for now....can re-open if Matteo continues to have trouble installing the latest version with the latest instructions, as indicated above.</p>",
